{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ssHNNzqFUMbt5AMqVMwXP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"$id\": \"https://schemas.agentic-scientist.local/scientific-evidence/artifact-manifest.schema.json\",\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"artifact\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"kind\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"source\",\n            \"derived\",\n            \"manuscript\",\n            \"figure\",\n            \"table\",\n            \"script\",\n            \"log\",\n            \"other\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"media_type\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"path\": {\n          \"description\": \"Path to the artifact relative to the scientific-evidence root when possible.\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"sha256\": {\n          \"description\": \"Optional hash recorded when the producing workflow computes one.\",\n          \"pattern\": \"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"path\",\n        \"kind\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"derived_from\": {\n      \"description\": \"Inline @evidence refs or stable ids describing the artifact inputs.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"minLength\": 1,\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    },\n    \"generated_by\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"command\": {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"cwd\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"finished_at\": {\n          \"format\": \"date-time\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"script_path\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"script_sha256\": {\n          \"pattern\": \"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\n# scientific-evidence\n\nThis is the canonical generated spec bundle for the `scientific-evidence` skill.\nUse the skill script as the source of truth for schemas, layout, and wording.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis contract is generic and file-format-agnostic.\nIt supports inline evidence refs in text-like files, adjacent `.prov.json` sidecars for generated artifacts, and a central JSONL ledger.\n\n## Why this exists\n\nThe point of `scientific-evidence` is to make an agent leave a machine-checkable trail for important numbers, figures, tables, and derived outputs.\nA paper or report should not depend on free-form prose alone when those claims can point back to real artifacts.\nAlways use this contract during paper writing whenever the agent adds manuscript numbers, table values, figure inputs, or derived statistics.\n\n## Fixed directory structure\n\n```text\nscientific-evidence/\n  spec.md\n  bundle.manifest.json\n  ledger.jsonl\n  schemas/\n    evidence-reference.schema.json\n    artifact-manifest.schema.json\n    ledger-entry.schema.json\n    verification-report.schema.json\n```\n\nAgents should use this layout exactly. Do not invent alternate bundle directories.\n\n## Grammar\n\n```text\nEvidenceRef   := '@evidence[[' Target [ '#' Locator ] ']]'\nTarget        := non-empty path | absolute path | URI | stable identifier\nLocator       := opaque fragment without closing ']]'\nSidecar       := '<artifact>.prov.json'\nLedger        := 'scientific-evidence/ledger.jsonl'\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- `Target` stays generic. The verifier may classify it as `path`, `absolute-path`, `uri`, `id`, or `unknown`.\n- `Locator` is opaque unless a verifier adapter knows how to interpret it.\n- Text-like artifacts should use inline `@evidence[[...]]` refs. Binary or generated outputs should carry an adjacent `.prov.json` sidecar.\n\n### Minimal examples\n\n- `@evidence[[TARGET]]`\n- `@evidence[[TARGET#LOCATOR]]`\n- `figure.png.prov.json`\n\n## Verification behavior\n\nA verifier uses this bundle to inspect whether the agent left a connected evidence trail.\nThe base verifier uses three reference states:\n\n- `resolved`: the target exists and the verifier can validate the locator semantics it understands.\n\"dict_keys(['FigureFontSizes', 'LegacyFigureManifestFigure', 'RichFigureFiles', 'RichFigureManifestFigure', 'RichFigurePanel'])\"\n{\n\"attempted_generator\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"enum\": [\n\"generate-concept-figure\",\n\"matplotlib\",\n\"tikz\",\n\"native_latex\",\n\"manual\"\n],\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Attempted Generator\"\n},\n\"caption_short\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Caption Short\"\n},\n\"estimated_min_rendered_font_pt\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"type\": \"number\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Estimated Min Rendered Font Pt\"\n},\n\"fallback_reason\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Fallback Reason\"\n},\n\"figure_id\": {\n\"minLength\": 1,\n\"title\": \"Figure Id\",\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n\"figure_type\": {\n\"enum\": [\n\"grouped_bar\",\n\"bar\",\n\"line\",\n\"box\",\n\"violin\",\n\"scatter\",\n\"heatmap\",\n\"table_matrix\",\n\"table\",\n\"composite\",\n\"diagram\"\n],\n\"title\": \"Figure Type\",\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n\"files\": {\n\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/RichFigureFiles\"\n},\n\"font_sizes\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FigureFontSizes\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null\n},\n\"generator\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"enum\": [\n\"generate-concept-figure\",\n\"matplotlib\",\n\"tikz\",\n\"native_latex\",\n\"manual\"\n],\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Generator\"\n},\n\"intended_latex_width_fraction\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"maximum\": 1,\n\"type\": \"number\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Intended Latex Width Fraction\"\n},\n\"label\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Label\"\n},\n\"max_label_chars\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"type\": \"integer\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Max Label Chars\"\n},\n\"min_font_size_pt\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"type\": \"number\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Min Font Size Pt\"\n},\n\"note\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Note\"\n},\n\"panel_count\": {\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"title\": \"Panel Count\",\n\"type\": \"integer\"\n},\n\"panels\": {\n\"items\": {\n\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/RichFigurePanel\"\n},\n\"title\": \"Panels\",\n\"type\": \"array\"\n},\n\"panels_per_row\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n\"type\": \"integer\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Panels Per Row\"\n},\n\"placement\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"enum\": [\n\"column\",\n\"full_width\"\n],\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Placement\"\n},\n\"prompt_log_path\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"string\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null,\n\"title\": \"Prompt Log Path\"\n},\n\"required\": {\n\"anyOf\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"boolean\"\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"null\"\n}\n],\n\"default\": null