,[\"final.metric.macro_log_mae\"])\nc(\"Maximum relative deviation of predictions across relabeled copies is 0.0.\",[\"final.metric.perm_max_rel_dev\"])\nc(\"Three seeded episodes (seeds 201, 202, 203) each give score -0.18137 with durations of about 0.06 seconds; the spread across episodes is zero.\",[\"final.evidence.episodes\"])\nc(\"The sealed evaluation completed and its outcome is qualified; candidate diagnostics are unverified.\",[\"final.qualification.outcome\",\"final.qualification.status\",\"final.qualification.correct\",\"final.evidence.episodes\"])\nc(\"Selection context: the studied configuration is the retained reference; 1 alternative candidate, 0 scored, 1 unscored; investigation completed without a winner; search score delta 0.0.\",[\"study.selection_kind\",\"study.attempts.total\",\"study.attempts.scored\",\"study.attempts.unscored\",\"study.investigation_outcome\",\"study.search_score_delta\"])\nc(\"Selection score of the retained configuration is -0.1913 on selection test graphs, a different evaluation scope from the sealed final metrics.\",[\"study.search_score\",\"study.baseline_score\",\"final.metric.combined_score\"])\nc(\"Protocol facts (36 training graphs, 24 test graphs, 12 families, about 300 walks, clip 10, tolerance 1e-6, seeds 201-203) describe the setting in which the sealed family-macro log MAE is computed; derived from protocol_inputs/ via protocol_facts.json.\",[\"final.metric.macro_log_mae\",\"final.evidence.episodes\"])\nc(\"The closed-form log overshoot of the bound is about 0.54, 1.39, 2.0 and 5.4 at n=30 for path, cycle, star and complete graphs; derived analytically (closed_form_gap.json) and verified against exact enumeration at n=7. Not an empirical measurement from the run.\",[\"final.qualification.status\"])\nc(\"Feige's upper bound (4/27+o(1))n^3 and lower bound (1+o(1)) n ln n on cover time of connected graphs.\",[\"ref.s2.3fd43be5cd805edb3b4f49e2f250a1cead558c43\",\"ref.s2.fd5abaa009c1bf1ffbf92ef33e4c556560009774\"],[\"Feige1995ATU\",\"Feige1995ATL\"])\nc(\"Cover and hitting times have been derived for particular random graph models such as hyperbolic random graphs.\",[\"ref.s2.72156e55f0735a30720b4a46e19a142deb951753\"],[\"Kiwi2022CoverAH\"])\njson.dump({\"claims\":C},open('claims_grounding.json','w'),indent=1)\n\nfm={\"figures\":[\n {\"figure_id\":\"overview_pipeline\",\"figure_type\":\"diagram\",\"files\":{\"png\":\"figures/overview_pipeline.png\"},\"panel_count\":1,\"panels\":[{\"panel_id\":\"a\",\"label\":\"pipeline overview\",\"content\":\"graph to statistics to ridge to comparison with Monte Carlo label, bound, constant and shuffled control; aggregation hierarchy\",\"category_count\":5,\"series_count\":1}],\"uses_progression\":False,\"generator\":\"generate-concept-figure\",\"prompt_log_path\":\"figures/overview_pipeline.prompts.json\",\"source_ids\":[],\"placement\":\"full_width\",\"intended_latex_width_fraction\":1.0,\"estimated_min_rendered_font_pt\":8,\"required\":True,\"label\":\"fig:overview\",\"caption_short\":\"Study overview\"},\n {\"figure_id\":\"main_comparison\",\"figure_type\":\"bar\",\"files\":{\"pdf\":\"figures/main_comparison.pdf\",\"png\":\"figures/main_comparison.png\"},\"panel_count\":1,\"panels\":[{\"panel_id\":\"a\",\"label\":\"family-macro log MAE\",\"metric\":\"macro_log_mae (lower is better)\",\"content\":\"ridge, constant, shuffled-target control, 2m(n-1) bound\",\"category_count\":4,\"series_count\":1}],\"uses_progression\":False,\"generator\":\"matplotlib\",\"source_ids\":[\"final.metric.macro_log_mae\",\"final.metric.bound_macro_log_mae\",\"final.metric.const_macro_log_mae\",\"final.metric.shuffle_macro_log_mae\"],\"placement\":\"full_width\",\"intended_latex_width_fraction\":0.7,\"estimated_min_rendered_font_pt\":7.7,\"uses_abbrev_labels\":True,\"max_label_chars\":12,\"required\":True,\"label\":\"fig:main\",\"caption_short\":\"Family-macro log MAE of four predictors\"},\n {\"figure_id\":\"closed_form_gap\",\"figure_type\":\"line\",\"files\":{\"